        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、一石につき四両六合五才替"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Provided that the exchange is 4.605 ryo per koku (合 .1, 勺 skipped, 才 .001). Applied to the 5,587.473 koku of soybeans this gives 25,730.313 ryo, not the 25,729.116 printed in the column above."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "大豆合代但書"
      }
    ],
